{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15110160","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15110160","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1511016001:0":{"text":"おのれ、デューラ……","source_cn":"艾雅，可恨的艾雅……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x80A629499583FF23","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1511016002:1":{"text":"なぜ、妾の神域に立ち入った……なぜ、妾とペルセウスの運命を邪魔する！？","source_cn":"为什么要踏足我的神域，为什么要来干涉我与珀尔修斯的命运？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7EB02054CE0A02ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1511016003:1":{"text":"生命の木は、貴様の所有物ではない！貴様の神権を使い、ペルセウスを妾の元に連れ戻すのじゃ！","source_cn":"生命树不是你一个人的所有物！行使你的神权，让珀尔修斯回...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC9B74C1FA8BEED6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1511016004:0":{"text":"……生命の法則は、ただ従うべきもの。私には、それに逆らう術はありません。","source_cn":"……生命的规则，只能遵守，那也并非我能撼动之物。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x259299E6845591F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1511016005:0":{"text":"神権……？生命の法則？","source_cn":"神权……？生命的规则？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x17819FC0A78C08B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1511016006:0":{"text":"マーリン、君は俺に何を隠してるんだ？","source_cn":"梅林，你瞒了我什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0240E37C8BE9AE03","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1511016007:0":{"text":"そいつと旅を共にしながら、正体を知らなかったのか？","source_cn":"你们与她同行一路，竟然不知她是谁。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x86300F841BB01FAB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1511016008:1":{"text":"そいつは、偉大にして崇高なる<style=\"highlight\">生命の女神</style>じゃ！デューラよ、貴様、凡俗どもにどれほどの嘘をついてきた？欺瞞こそ、貴様にふさわしい神域であろう！","source_cn":"伟大的——崇高的<style=highlight>生命...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x238B0F66E6C5D5AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1511016009:0":{"text":"そこにいる獣人の子を見よ。妾を崇めるはずの信徒が、今や怒りの目を妾に向けておる！","source_cn":"看看你身边那个兽人孩子——她明明是我的信徒，却用仇视的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD4913F277EDAA1FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1511016010:1":{"text":"妾の領土も、信徒も、創造物も、愛する者も……これ以上、貴様に奪わせはせぬ！","source_cn":"我的疆土，我的信徒，我的造物，我的爱……你再也不能夺走了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEDD2F2AE9DE69DD2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1511016011:1":{"text":"マーリンさんは……神だったのですか？","source_cn":"梅林……是神？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C2FAEEADA93F7F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1511016012:1":{"text":"黙れ、この裏切り者が！貴様は妾の創造物、妾を敬うのが本分であろう！","source_cn":"闭嘴，叛徒，你是我的造物，本应崇敬我！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFF8F92229CD39494","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1511016013:0":{"text":"……わたしはもう、どんな神も敬いません。","source_cn":"……我已经不崇敬任何神。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9DC49CFDA33F61EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1511016014:0":{"text":"わたしが信じるのは、<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>さまです！","source_cn":"我信仰，<style=stress><player_n...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x1C64126687A1A3E0","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"わたしが信じるのは、<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>さまです！","female":"わたしが信じるのは、<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>さまです！","variant_male_record_index":"175883","variant_female_record_index":"175884","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1511016015:0":{"text":"くだらん！ペルセウスを蘇らせた後は、貴様を生命の木に還してくれる！","source_cn":"——够了！等我唤回珀尔修斯，就让你回归生命树！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC7C0BC43FBDFC9C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1511016016:0":{"text":"ペルセウスを生き返らせることはできません、アウファカ。","source_cn":"你救不了珀尔修斯，奥法迦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE28CA5BD2C87BCBE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1511016017:0":{"text":"人間も、生命の木に生る一枚の葉。枯れ葉が落ちる時、人は命の終わり……つまり、死を迎えるのです。","source_cn":"凡人皆是生命树上的一枚叶片。当叶片凋落，凡人也迎来生命...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCCC7715296A79024","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1511016018:0":{"text":"現実を受け入れましょう、アウファカ。ペルセウスの葉はすでに枯れ、魂は生命の木に還りました。たとえ、同じ場所に新たな葉が芽吹いても、それはもうあなたが愛した人ではありません。","source_cn":"认清现实吧，奥法迦。属于珀尔修斯的那一片叶已经凋落，他...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x190A915D491AE0B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1511016019:0":{"text":"死神に祈れば、あるいは可能かもしれませんが……神が別の神に祈ったりはしないでしょう？","source_cn":"除非你向死神祈求……但一位神，会向另一位神祈求吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x31F95036A2C7EF77","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1511016020:0":{"text":"それに、死神がどこにいるのかは、誰も分からないのですから。","source_cn":"谁又知道死神现在何方呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFFF4A49BBF595A38","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1511016021:1":{"text":"ならぬ……死神にペルセウスの魂は触れさせん！死など、この妾が決して許さん！","source_cn":"不……死神休想染指珀尔修斯的灵魂，我禁止他的死亡！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xED0F3D29F180C15E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1511016022:0":{"text":"同じ神である貴様が命を授けられるなら、妾にもできるはずじゃ！","source_cn":"你我皆是神！你能赐予生命，我为何不能——？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x446826B08CA483E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1511016023:0":{"text":"まだ木の力を吸収しているぞ！","source_cn":"她还在抽取生命树的力量！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x224B612681F1DD6F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1511016024:0":{"text":"アウファカ……","source_cn":"奥法迦……<key:dialog2>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD1625AA20721FFC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:42:1511016025:1":{"text":"誰も、妾の邪魔をするな！","source_cn":"——休想再阻止我！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA5B8A867E13B07F5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:43:1511016026:0":{"text":"必ず、成功させてみせる……<style=\"highlight\">もうすぐ、目を覚ます</style>ぞ！","source_cn